                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino cintu ncitukonzya kulilumbaizya nceeci, Manjezeezya esu alatuzuminina kuti ansi ano, nkabela kwiinda zyoonse killindinywe, ziyanza zyesu zyakali zyakusalala azyabwinibwini, teezyakali yabusongo bwabantunsi buyo pe, pele zyaluzyalo lwa-Leza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.1.12",
