        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakakanza kwiinda kulindinywe ciindi cakuya ku-Makedoniya, alimwi akumuswaya ciindi cakuboola kuzwa ku-Makedoniya akusindikizigwa andinywe kulweendo lwangu lwakuya ku-Judaya, ",
          "type": "text",
